  <p class="eyebrow">Archives</p>
  <h1>The original websites, and the rest</h1>
  <p class="lede">The collective's two websites are preserved here as they were, with their iWeb pages, their image buttons and their typos: the hard-drive backup, and what the Wayback Machine had kept on top of it. A few personal email addresses and phone numbers were removed; everything else is intact. The archived pages are in French.</p>

  <div class="cards">
